  <div class="lp-heading"><h2>What makes a commercial contractor lead worth pursuing?</h2><p>Check that the job fits your trade, territory and minimum scope. Start with the person who can invite you to inspect, quote or join the bid list.</p></div>
  <div class="sg-table-wrap"><table class="lp-table sg-table" role="table">
    <caption>Common contractor buyers and the next steps to qualify.</caption>
    <thead><tr role="row"><th scope="col" role="columnheader">Work you sell</th><th scope="col" role="columnheader">Who to call</th><th scope="col" role="columnheader">What to confirm</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr role="row"><th scope="row" role="rowheader"><a href="/resources/cold-call-scripts/commercial-hvac-maintenance-cold-call-script/">HVAC and mechanical maintenance</a></th><td role="cell" data-label="Who to call">Facilities or operations manager</td><td role="cell" data-label="What to confirm">Service area, equipment scope and the current agreement’s review date.</td></tr>
      <tr role="row"><th scope="row" role="rowheader"><a href="/resources/cold-call-scripts/commercial-roofing-cold-call-script-property-managers/">Commercial roofing and inspections</a></th><td role="cell" data-label="Who to call">Property manager or building owner</td><td role="cell" data-label="What to confirm">Property type, reason for inspection and who can approve access.</td></tr>
      <tr role="row"><th scope="row" role="rowheader"><a href="/resources/cold-call-scripts/commercial-cleaning-cold-call-script-property-owners/">Cleaning and facilities services</a></th><td role="cell" data-label="Who to call">Facilities or procurement lead</td><td role="cell" data-label="What to confirm">Number of sites, service hours and the next vendor review.</td></tr>
