  <aside class="shortlist-feature" aria-labelledby="contractor-prep-heading">
    <h3 id="contractor-prep-heading">Give every provider the same job brief</h3>
    <p>List the property types, service radius, minimum job size and visits you can handle each week. Give providers one recent job to use as a model.</p>
    <p>Map your buyers with the <a href="/b2b-outbound-campaign-planner/">campaign planner</a>. Test your opening with the <a href="/cold-call-script-checker/">cold call script checker</a> and use the <a href="/b2b-meeting-quality-check/">meeting quality check</a> to set your acceptance rules.</p>
